Subject: [PATCH] C1's normal form moves to its own module
 (ClassNP/NDNormalForm)

Turing.FinNDTM.exists_codeNDTM_accepts_linear, with its docstring, byte-identical, moves from
Diagonalization/NTimeHierarchy into the new ClassNP/NDNormalForm (imports NTIME and NDCodes, as
ExhaustiveReplay). NTimeHierarchy imports it; the ClassNP facade lists it. The user's ruling of
2026-10-17 (C1's fill plan, question 3): NF's fill then runs beside the universal machine's in
NTimeHierarchy, since two workers cannot share a file. No statement changes.

